Fine-tuning pre-trained AI models enhances their performance, improves efficiency, and customizes them for specific tasks like text generation, image synthesis, AI-driven creativity, and automation. This AI/ML/DL Masterclass (Session 225) provides an in-depth look at:

What You’ll Learn in This Session:
✅ What is Fine-Tuning in AI? – Understanding transfer learning & model adaptation
✅ Why Fine-Tuning is Crucial for Generative AI?
✅ Pre-Trained AI Models for Fine-Tuning: GPT-4, LLaMA, Stable Diffusion, DALL·E, Midjourney
✅ Fine-Tuning vs. Prompt Engineering – Key Differences
✅ Advanced Techniques for Fine-Tuning: Transfer Learning, LoRA, Parameter Efficient Fine-Tuning (PEFT)
✅ Optimizing AI for Specific Applications:

Text Generation 📝 – Chatbots, Content Writing, Code Completion
Image Generation 🎨 – AI-Generated Art, Design, Branding
Speech & Audio AI 🎙️ – AI Music, Voice Cloning, Speech Synthesis
Healthcare AI 🏥 – Medical Diagnosis, Drug Discovery
Finance AI 💰 – AI Trading, Risk Analysis
✅ Real-World Case Studies & Success Stories
✅ Hands-on Fine-Tuning with Hugging Face & TensorFlow
